    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/3d3cb8d9be737602adfb81611ce8f7ca.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/ce1ad8d41379a7df6053d525fcd55cd3.poster.avif?t=1734973313\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/ce1ad8d41379a7df6053d525fcd55cd3.apng?t=1734973313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><i>A mysterious evil-doer has emerged from the unknown to create a sinister new world. With nobody else left to defeat him, it is on you and any other misguided souls you stumble upon to put an end to his dastardly plot.</i><br><br>Jump, fly and race through several lands - from the sunny oasis of the Diamond Desert, to the gloomy swamps of the Mystic Stormlands - to save the world from the most dangerous weapon ever constructed.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/16337935585eef5168ca70a24d730dc8.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/rotate2.gif?t=1734973313\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/22098fbb1139c6bdfb1dd602eab8df4c.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div> 6 Playable Characters with unique powers and abilities.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/22098fbb1139c6bdfb1dd602eab8df4c.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div> 60+ Levels spanning across 10 fully explorable worlds<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/22098fbb1139c6bdfb1dd602eab8df4c.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div> Multiple approaches and secret ways through the storyline<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/22098fbb1139c6bdfb1dd602eab8df4c.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div> 100 Shiny Golden Rocks to collect<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/22098fbb1139c6bdfb1dd602eab8df4c.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div> A complete original soundtrack featuring over 60+ songs",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/3d3cb8d9be737602adfb81611ce8f7ca.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/ce1ad8d41379a7df6053d525fcd55cd3.poster.avif?t=1734973313\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/ce1ad8d41379a7df6053d525fcd55cd3.apng?t=1734973313\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><i>A mysterious evil-doer has emerged from the unknown to create a sinister new world. With nobody else left to defeat him, it is on you and any other misguided souls you stumble upon to put an end to his dastardly plot.</i><br><br>Jump, fly and race through several lands - from the sunny oasis of the Diamond Desert, to the gloomy swamps of the Mystic Stormlands - to save the world from the most dangerous weapon ever constructed.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/16337935585eef5168ca70a24d730dc8.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/rotate2.gif?t=1734973313\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/22098fbb1139c6bdfb1dd602eab8df4c.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div> 6 Playable Characters with unique powers and abilities.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/22098fbb1139c6bdfb1dd602eab8df4c.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div> 60+ Levels spanning across 10 fully explorable worlds<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/22098fbb1139c6bdfb1dd602eab8df4c.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div> Multiple approaches and secret ways through the storyline<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/22098fbb1139c6bdfb1dd602eab8df4c.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div> 100 Shiny Golden Rocks to collect<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935830/extras/22098fbb1139c6bdfb1dd602eab8df4c.webp?t=1734973313\" /></div> A complete original soundtrack featuring over 60+ songs",
